 7. Future/Problems
 °°°°°°°°°°°°°°°°°°
 - Possibility to use SadoModem in any prompt.

   There's two reasons why SadoModem currently requires a particular
   subboard: 

   1) The upload-adding is a hack and I don't know if it works in
      all situations. I don't want it trashing any important fileareas.
   2) I don't know how to make CNet to reload the subboard filelists
      from disk -> "Keep Buffers" must be NO which is certainly not
      wanted for all areas.

 - Increasing the download counters. If someone tells me 
   how this can be done (and done efficiently!) I might do it. 

 - Perhaps making the things in the "And what not:" part to work.

 If you'd like some new feature or know solutions to some problems, 
 please email me.


